          <ol>
            <li><a href="#short-answer">Should You Buy a Treadmill at Dick's Sporting Goods?</a></li>
            <li><a href="#in-store-testing">The In-Store Testing Advantage</a></li>
            <li><a href="#selection">What Selection to Expect</a></li>
            <li><a href="#reading-specs">Reading the Spec Card on the Floor</a></li>
